export anchor TarotNightStyle:
    number: 282
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Tarot night
    idea: A tarot spread laid out on a starry indigo cloth, three framed cards with fine gold line art, corner stars and crescent moons, the selected file drawn as its own card.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #0e0b1e, the page cloth, fields and the preview ground
        card: #18132e, the three cards and the style sheet
        cardTwo: #211a3d, the current nav and the pressed switch
        selected: #2b2252, the selected row inside a gold line
        gold: #e0c171, line art, corner stars, headings, the primary button with dark text #1a1430, medallions and Starred
        goldLine: #8e7a48, frames and dotted rules, never text
        ink: #f1eadb, text
        muted: #bfb7d2, meta, labels and italics
        moon: #a9c8ff, Shared and focus
        rose: #f3a9c6, Uploading and its moon phase dots
    type:
        One book serif, Baskerville, Libre Baskerville, Garamond, Times New
        Roman. The folder title is 44px small caps tracked 0.1em, card
        headings 18px gold small caps tracked 0.18em between dashes, file
        names 17px, body 16px. Meta, kinds and statuses are italic, 13 to
        14px.
    layout:
        A deep indigo cloth with a scattered star field. A centred header
        has a gold crescent moon with a small star, Brightwork Drive in
        gold small caps, the title Website redesign and an italic
        breadcrumb with star separators. Below lies a spread of three
        cards. Each card has a 14px radius, a dull gold outer line, an
        inner frame 7px in and a small four point gold star at each
        corner. The left card, Drive, lists the five links with My files
        ringed in gold, then a gold storage ring with a moon inside and
        64.2 GB of 100 GB used. The middle card, The files, has a pill
        search, Upload, New folder and a pill List or Grid switch, then
        eight rows split by dotted gold rules. Each row has a round gold
        medallion with the type icon, the name over an italic kind, the
        size, and date and person with italic statuses. The selected row is
        a violet band in a gold line. Uploading adds five moon phase dots
        with three filled. The right card, Details, shows the preview
        inside a sun and moon line drawing, the name on a ruled banner,
        Starred, facts on dotted rules and full width Share, Download and
        Get link. Below 1100px Details moves under the others. Below 740px
        the cards stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28px between cards, 26px card padding, 12px rows.
    density: Relaxed. Three cards with generous margins.
    corners: 14px cards with a 9px inner frame, pills for controls, round medallions.
    borders: 1px dull gold outer and inner frames, dotted gold rules between rows.
    shadows: A soft long drop under each card, nothing else.
    icons:
        1.3px fine line icons in gold medallions. Status is an italic word
        with a star for Starred, two heads for Shared, an up arrow for
        Uploading and a checked box for Selected.
    focus: A 2px pale moon blue outline offset 3px with a faint halo.
    tone: Hushed and a little mystical in headings, such as The files and Drive, and plain in data.
